<title>NETHERLANDS: FORECAST- Dutch company results March 24 - April 4.</title>
<headline>FORECAST- Dutch company results March 24 - April 4.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of Dutch company results for the two weeks from March 24 to April 4:</p>
<p>DATE--COMPANY-----PERIOD--PROFIT------CONSENSUS---RANGE-----PVS 25/3  HBG	   YR 96   net ord ops    115     106/120     97</p>
<p>25/3  HBG	   YR 96   net incl xo    109     102/114    104</p>
<p>26/3  Fortis	YR 96   net ord ops    732     720/743    631</p>
<p>27/3  Nutricia    YR 96   net ord ops    230     220/237    152</p>
<p> 3/4  ING	   YR 96   net ord ops   3223    3166/3363  2649</p>
<p>NOTES - Profit figures exclude extraordinary items and are in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated. They also exclude dividends on preference shares where applicable.</p>
<p>*FORTIS figures are for whole group in European currency units (ECUs).</p>
<p>FORECASTS CONTRIBUTED BY: Amstgeld, Bangert Pontier, BZW, Delta Lloyd Bank, Generale Bank, ING, Kempen &amp; Co, Labouchere, Van Lanschot, MeesPierson, Rabo/IRIS, Suez Nederland, Wesselius, Wijs &amp; Van Oostveen.</p>
<p>-- M. van Oenen/A. Kelly, Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
